Ladybird fits an SVG image element’s image to the element’s rectangle as
its preserveAspectRatio says, taking the image’s natural size as its
view box. All three other engines do the same: Gecko’s SVGImageFrame
with SVGContentUtils::GetViewBoxTransform(), WebKit’s RenderSVGImage
with calculateSVGImagePlacement(), and Blink’s SVGImagePainter with
SVGPreserveAspectRatio::TransformRect().
